    "text": "By Alaina Gross ,\n8 hours ago Ralph Stover State Park in Pipersville is a beautiful spot for those looking to spend some time outside, with amazing views and lots to explore. One of Pipersville’s hidden gems is Ralph Stover State Park, a 45-acre marvel with stunning views, impressive cliffs and beautiful waterways, writes Claire Allard for Family Destinations Guide. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
